<body bgcolor="lightyellow" text="black">

<a name="rahand"></a>

  <h1 align="center">🏷 Web Design & Development — Demo Page</h1>
  <hr size="5" color="blue" width="400" align="center">

  <h2>Text Formatting</h2>
  <p>This is <b>bold</b>, <i>italic</i>, <u>underlined</u>, 
     <mark>highlighted</mark>, CO<sub>2</sub>, X<sup>3</sup>-2X<sup>2</sup>+1.</p>

  <h2>Lists</h2>
  <h3>Unordered</h3>
  <ul type="square">
    <li>Coffee</li>
    <li>Tea</li>
    <li>Milk</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Ordered with Nested</h3>
  <ol type="I">
    <li>Item one</li>
    <li>Item two
      <ol type="a">
        <li>Sub one</li>
        <li>Sub two</li>
      </ol>
    </li>
    <li>Item three</li>
  </ol>

  <h3>Description List</h3>
  <dl>
    <dt>Hardware</dt>
    <dd>Tangible part of computer</dd>
    <dt>Software</dt>
    <dd>Programs & data</dd>
  </dl>

  <h2>Links</h2>
  <p><a href="http://www.google.com" target="_blank">Google</a></p>
  <p><a href="mailto:example@mail.com">Send Email</a></p>
  <p><a href="#bookmark">Jump to Bookmark Below</a></p>

  <h2>Colors</h2>
  <h3 style="background-color:tomato">Tomato Color (name)</h3>
  <h3 style="background-color:rgb(255,0,0)">RGB Red</h3>
  <h3 style="background-color:#00ff00">HEX Green</h3>
  <h3 style="background-color:hsl(240,100%,50%)">HSL Blue</h3>
  <h3 style="background-color:rgba(255,99,71,0.5)">RGBA Transparent</h3>

  <h2>Images</h2>
